    <h2 class="sec__title reveal r1">精选项目 — <em>Spec Sheets</em></h2>

    <!-- WORK-01 : BMS -->
    <article class="spec reveal">
      <div class="spec__head">
        <span class="spec__no">01</span>
        <div class="spec__titlebox">
          <h3 class="spec__name">Vue 3 Monorepo 仓储售后系统</h3>
          <p class="spec__role">Vue 3 · Monorepo · Schema-driven UI</p>
        </div>
        <span class="spec__stamp">■ Deployed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__body">
        <p class="spec__summary">
          接手时是 3 个互相复制粘贴的仓库，重构为一个 <strong>Monorepo</strong>——9 个共享包，依赖方向单向。最核心的是<strong>配置驱动 CRUD 引擎</strong>：后端下发 JSON Schema，前端动态渲染列表和表单，配套可视化 FormDesigner 让非开发人员拖拽即可产出 Schema 上线。API 端点去重 -92%（1,600 → 120）。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__foot">
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">−92%</span><span class="spec__metric-k">代码文件</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">10×</span><span class="spec__metric-k">构建速度</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">40+</span><span class="spec__metric-k">零代码页面</span></span>
        <div class="spec__stack">
          <span class="tag">Vue 3</span><span class="tag">Vite 7</span><span class="tag">Pinia 3</span><span class="tag">Turborepo</span><span class="tag">Element Plus</span><span class="tag">SSE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- WORK-02 : ServicePioneer -->
    <article class="spec reveal r1">
      <div class="spec__head">
        <span class="spec__no">02</span>
        <div class="spec__titlebox">
          <h3 class="spec__name">React Native 仓储作业 App</h3>
          <p class="spec__role">React Native · Expo · Zustand</p>
        </div>
        <span class="spec__stamp">■ Deployed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__body">
        <p class="spec__summary">
          <strong>React Native 0.83 + Expo SDK 55</strong> 从零重写，46 页面 + 22 组件，替代旧 uni-app 方案。核心<strong>波次拣货</strong>用双数组驱动 + 乐观更新——跨多页操作流程浓缩到一个页面，操作步骤减少 50%。<strong>ScanProvider</strong> 统一抽象工业 PDA 扫码，换设备品牌不用改业务代码。离线弱网环境下依然可用是硬指标。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__foot">
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">46</span><span class="spec__metric-k">页面</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">−50%</span><span class="spec__metric-k">操作步骤</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">2</span><span class="spec__metric-k">平台 iOS+Android</span></span>
        <div class="spec__stack">
          <span class="tag">RN 0.83</span><span class="tag">Expo 55</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">Zustand</span><span class="tag">TanStack Query</span><span class="tag">NativeWind</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- WORK-03 : Wiki -->
    <article class="spec reveal r2">
      <div class="spec__head">
        <span class="spec__no">03</span>
        <div class="spec__titlebox">
          <h3 class="spec__name">RAG 企业知识库</h3>
          <p class="spec__role">Next.js 15 全栈 · AI 问答 · 零外部依赖</p>
        </div>
        <span class="spec__stamp">■ v0.2.1 Released</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__body">
        <p class="spec__summary">
          AI 驱动的企业知识库，Next.js 15 + SQLite 全栈独立开发。Tiptap 富文本编辑 + 树形目录 + 发布快照回滚；AI 问答走混合检索 RAG，回答带来源引用，SSE 流式输出；公开前台 SSR 对 SEO 友好，一行 script 嵌入外部网站。Docker 单容器部署，不需要 PostgreSQL、Redis 或任何外部服务。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec__foot">
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">v0.2.1</span><span class="spec__metric-k">最新版本</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">0</span><span class="spec__metric-k">外部依赖</span></span>
        <span class="spec__metric"><span class="spec__metric-v">1</span><span class="spec__metric-k">命令部署</span></span>
        <div class="spec__stack">
          <span class="tag">Next.js 15</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">SQLite</span><span class="tag">RAG</span><span class="tag">Docker</span><span class="tag">Tiptap</span>
        </div>
      </div>
